Verse 1:
[Eb7]I[Ab]gave my [Db]life for [Ab]thee, My precious [Bb7]blood I [Eb]shed,
[Eb7]That [Ab]thou might'st ransom [Db]be, And [Ab]quickened [Eb7]from the [Ab]dead;
[Ab]I[Eb]gave, I gave My [Ab]life [Db]for [Ab]thee, What [Eb]hast thou [Eb7]given for [Ab]Me?
[Ab]I[Eb]gave, I gave My [Db]life for [Ab]thee, What [Eb]hast thou [Eb7]given for [Ab]Me?

Verse 2:
[Eb7][Ab]My [Db]Fathers [Ab]house [Bb7]of [Eb]light,
[Eb7][Ab]My [Db]glory [Ab][Eb7]circled [Ab]throne,
[Ab][Eb]I [Ab][Db]left [Ab]for [Eb][Eb7]earthly [Ab]night,
[Ab][Eb]For [Db]wanderings [Ab][Eb]sad [Eb7]and [Ab]lone;
[Eb7]I [Ab]left, [Db]I left [Ab]it [Bb7]all [Eb]for thee,
[Eb7]Hast [Ab]thou [Db]left [Ab]aught [Eb7]for [Ab]Me?
[Ab]I [Eb]left, [Ab]I [Db]left [Ab]it [Eb]all [Eb7]for [Ab]thee,
[Ab][Eb]Hast [Db]thou [Ab]left [Eb]aught [Eb7]for [Ab]Me?

Verse 3:
[Eb7][Ab]I [Db]suffered [Ab]much [Bb7]for [Eb]thee,
[Eb7]more [Ab]than [Db]thy [Ab]tongue [Eb7]can [Ab]tell,
[Ab][Eb][Ab]Of [Db][Ab][Eb]bitterest [Eb7][Ab]agony,
[Ab][Eb]To [Db]rescue [Ab][Eb]thee [Eb7]from [Ab]hell;
[Eb7]I've [Ab]borne, [Db]I've borne [Ab]it [Bb7]all [Eb]for thee,
[Eb7]What [Ab]hast [Db]thou [Ab]borne [Eb7]for [Ab]Me?
[Ab]I've [Eb]borne, [Ab]I've [Db]borne [Ab]it [Eb]all [Eb7]for [Ab]thee,
[Ab][Eb]What [Db]hast [Ab]thou [Eb]borne [Eb7]for [Ab]Me?
